{
  "name": "aparctias-of-restores",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "mcpName": "io.github.fpavia111-creator/aparctias-of-restores",
  "description": "Aparctias of Restores: Restore test review: critical systems with no restore test inside your interval, failed tests not re-run, restores slower than the recovery time objective, restored data older than the recovery point, and tests with no sign-off. Writes a test calendar and drafts the next test plan.",
